### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension while `cds watch` is running

@server = http://localhost:4004

### All POs with their items
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/po/PurchaseOrders?$expand=items

### Filter: only USD orders, newest first
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/po/PurchaseOrders?$filter=currency eq 'USD'&$orderby=orderDate desc

### Service metadata (what Fiori reads to build the UI)
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/po/$metadata
